        <mxCell id="notes" value="PasswordVisibility only changes JPasswordField.echoChar. It does not transmit or persist password text. SecurityService always clears its temporary char[] in finally. The UI holds Session; logout clears it and creates a newly masked LoginView. Database accounts are checked by SecurityService; event ownership is checked again for Host operations." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;spacing=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fillColor=#FFF2CC;" vertex="1" parent="1">
