        <mxCell id="notes" value="One layout per event: at most 12 physical sections, 100 assigned seats each, 20 ticket offers. Legacy grids remain usable. Active bookings lock geometry and assignment; ticket names, colors and future prices can change. A failed write rolls back all changes. Purchased tickets keep their original type name, amount and seat label." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;spacing=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fillColor=#FFF2CC;" vertex="1" parent="1">
