        <mxCell id="notes" value="VenueBrowser opens a selected section in SeatGrid; the same seatSelected callback updates OpenEventUI. No hold or RESERVED state is created before checkout. The conditional AVAILABLE claim and unique active-seat index prevent two active bookings. A renamed offer invalidates a stale requested type name; saved offer prices are used. All payment outcomes are simulated." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;spacing=15;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fillColor=#FFF2CC;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="30" y="2483" width="2110" height="146" />
